# ===========================================================================
# OpenGlad relay — same-origin route for the host Apache TLS vhost
# (Crossroads Experience #3, M4 Slice 1F)
#
# DURABLE placement: add these two lines to
#   /etc/apache2/sites-enabled/binkterm.l33test.com-le-ssl.conf
# next to the existing `ProxyPass /ws` / `ProxyPass /dosdoor` lines, and commit
# that file to the host's config management. That is the difference from the
# Slice 1A/1E acceptance-time edit that was reverted at teardown.
#
# Needs mod_proxy + mod_proxy_http + mod_proxy_wstunnel (already loaded — /ws
# and /dosdoor use them). ws:// upgrades to wss:// automatically over the TLS
# vhost. The CSP already permits it: connect-src 'self' wss://binkterm.l33test.com
# covers wss://binkterm.l33test.com/openglad-relay — NO CSP change.
#
# Order: these must appear BEFORE the catch-all `ProxyPass / http://127.0.0.1:8090/`.
# ===========================================================================

ProxyPass        /openglad-relay ws://127.0.0.1:8090/openglad-relay
ProxyPassReverse /openglad-relay ws://127.0.0.1:8090/openglad-relay
